 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p></td><td style=\"border-right: none;word-break: break-all; border-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\" width=\"16%\" valign=\"top\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">信息公开形式</span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><br/>\n &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-left: none;word-break: break-all; border-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">部门签发：</span>\n &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><input type=\"text\" id=\"TB_BuMenQianFa\" name=\"TB_BuMenQianFa\" data-key=\"BuMenQianFa\" data-name=\"部门签发\" data-type=\"SignCheck\" leipiplugins=\"text\" style=\"width:98%\" placeholder=\"签批组件\"/></span>\n &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><br/></p></td><td style=\"border-right: none;word-break: break-all; border-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" height=\"120\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">办公室签发：</span>\n &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<input type=\"text\" id=\"TB_BanGongShiQianFa\" name=\"TB_BanGongShiQianFa\" data-key=\"BanGongShiQianFa\" data-name=\"办公室签发\" data-type=\"SignCheck\" leipiplugins=\"text\" style=\"width:98%\" placeholder=\"签批组件\"/>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<div id=\"SubFlow\" name=\"SubFlow\" data-info=\"006\" style=\"\"></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-left: none;word-break: break-all; border-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\" rowspan=\"2\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;拟稿单位</span>\n &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</td><td style=\"word-